{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1467775-solar-lingustics-revamp-ex3","id":1467775,"title":"Solar Lingustics Revamp (Ex3)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-14T00:28:06-08:00","id":1467775,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Solar Lingustics Revamp (Ex3)","content":"Words. Does your Solar character want to write words? Does your character want to speak words but are stopped by an ability that is utterly lackluster in depth?<br /> <br /> Sandact6 here, and I\u2019ve finished my latest charm revamp after weeks of procrastination. The Linguistics charm and ability revamp.<ul><li>The Linguistics ability is fleshed out into a more properly codified system regarding languages, written material ranging from letters to books, forgeries, understand language, and cyphers.</li> <li>A collection of brand-new languages that give the game some much needed linguistic diversity (or easily ignored)</li> <li>A revamped charmset that gives new playstyles on how to use language and books, with the added benefit of being actual functional charms and fewer smartass sidebars than in the core.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Grab your favourite cup of tea, kick back in your comfy chair, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O0njKftVY4iik2vRvXdVOVinxU3rb00NJeYvYOExDJM/edit\" target=\"_blank\">and read now</a>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":1183,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","user":"Sandact6","date":". 11-14-2021, 02:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-16T21:27:13-07:00","id":1452579,"title":"","content":"Good evening, everyone!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YxxL2vHrhWpoTwoghZjJW6Fd1jw_BalGacD-aaDWet4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Linguistics Remake is up</a> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> This one was a doozy, between creating aides to use the ability on its own, suggesting new uses for it and translating solar authority and radiance to the art of writing, we ended up with 30 charms :O<br /> <br /> A few of the classics make a return, but now your savvy interpreters and master cryptographers can make people go mad, and few are so well versed in the art of elevating (may I say exalting?) people to honor-or suffer- their titles as the Lawgivers. It is in the name after all!<br /> <br /> <br /> As always, feedback is welcome. I hope you enjoy this one!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":